{"id":"oponente","lemma":"oponente","pos":"adj","rank":4335,"glosses":["opposing"],"ipa":"/opoˈnente/","forms":{"femininePlural":"oponentes"},"examples":[{"text":"Eres un gran oponente.","en":"You're a worthy opponent.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/581728","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,null]},{"text":"No subestimes a tu oponente.","en":"Don't underestimate your opponent.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/582590","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to underestimate","l":"subestimar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"Él noqueó a su oponente.","en":"He knocked his opponent out.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to knock out","l":"noquear"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"El boxeador golpeó fuerte a su oponente.","en":"The boxer struck his opponent hard.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"boxer"},{"g":"to hit","l":"golpear"},{"g":"strong"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"El oponente más importante de Japón era China.","en":"Japan's most important opponent was China.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"more"},{"g":"important"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"Japanese"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"china"}]}]}